Over relay the agnet should be able to configure maximum size of incoming msg (default), per-sender max-size, default per-sender rate limit, individual per-sender rate limit, per-machine incoming rate limit, etc. All of this I think can be managed locally so that we don't need to send this stuff to the relayer.
